        "question_text": "<p>What is the inversion of a <b>perfect fifth</b> ($5$) interval?</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The inversion of an interval is calculated by subtracting it from 9. Thus, the inversion of a perfect fifth ($5$) is $9 - 5 = 4$, which is a <i>perfect fourth</i>.</p>",
